{"name": "Stitchlings", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"340\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/f3165f0348da178da377891e815b3d60.poster.avif?t=1779476355\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/f3165f0348da178da377891e815b3d60.webm?t=1779476355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/f3165f0348da178da377891e815b3d60.mp4?t=1779476355\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stitchlings is a singleplayer &amp; couch co-op action game where the monsters you defeat become parts to stitch onto your character, allowing you to customize your combat style and dress up your Stitchling! Grab a friend and embark on a grand adventure to rekindle a fading world where all you have is each other.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"340\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/a37a6587658b76d44165f89fce0c9bcb.poster.avif?t=1779476355\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/a37a6587658b76d44165f89fce0c9bcb.webm?t=1779476355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/a37a6587658b76d44165f89fce0c9bcb.mp4?t=1779476355\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment with different playstyles by swapping out<strong> 5 unique trinkets</strong>, dropped by enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your Stitchling and gain stat bonuses with<strong> 5 collectible cosmetic items</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"340\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/380b4774a7931691b4d3cf9216fac158.poster.avif?t=1779476355\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/380b4774a7931691b4d3cf9216fac158.webm?t=1779476355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/380b4774a7931691b4d3cf9216fac158.mp4?t=1779476355\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab a friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Designed for same-screen play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compatible with 2 controllers, keyboard/controller, and Steam Remote Play Together</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"498\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/35d6e711f486cb702e3edab801f9cc25.poster.avif?t=1779476355\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/35d6e711f486cb702e3edab801f9cc25.webm?t=1779476355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/extras/35d6e711f486cb702e3edab801f9cc25.mp4?t=1779476355\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore The Workshop, a miniature - yet spectacularly grand - patchwork world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your survival skills against fabric foes and challenging bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reclaim the world that was once yours - together!</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Play solo, or grab a friend and embark on a bite-sized co-op combat adventure fighting toy monsters, picking them apart, while you stitch together your uniquely customized Stitchlings!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4200560/50d68c38432d8aacf464db7fff33e5ed22bf6db8/header.jpg?t=1779476355", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Local Co-Op", "Beat 'em up", "Character Customization", "Hack and Slash", "Action", "Adventure"], "developers": "Studio Woolworks", "publishers": "Studio Woolworks", "release_date": "May 12, 2026", "price": "Free To Play", "appid": "4200560", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 May 2026 - Free To Play", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Rs_BN1LfsOg", "first_seen": 1778544000.0, "review_rank": 647}